# Fortune, Loyal Steed attacking without being saddled does nothing: its trigger is "whenever Fortune attacks while saddled"
# (CR 702.171), so on turn 3 an unsaddled attack leaves no delayed trigger, nothing is exiled, and at end of combat Fortune is
# the very same still-tapped attacker, with no second scry and nothing on the stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Fortune, Loyal Steed
Plains
Thraben Inspector
Savannah Lions
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

